<title>USA: Livingston Cty., Mich., won by Nike Securities.</title>
<headline>Livingston Cty., Mich., won by Nike Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nike Securities Inc. said it won $3 million of Livingston Cty, Mich., general obligation limited tax joint water system bonds, Series D, with a net interest cost of 5.571 percent.</p>
</text>
